## Additional Setup Notes

According to the official Vercel documentation, to complete the Analytics setup:

1. **Enable Analytics in Vercel Dashboard**:
   - Navigate to your project in the Vercel dashboard
   - Go to the Analytics section
   - Enable Web Analytics

2. **Deploy Application**:
   - Deploy using `vercel deploy`
   - Analytics will start tracking after deployment

3. **Verify Tracking**:
   - After deployment, check browser Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`
   - Data will appear in the Vercel dashboard after users visit the site

## Conclusion

No changes were required. The project already has Vercel Web Analytics properly installed and configured according to the latest official documentation. The Analytics component is correctly imported from `@vercel/analytics/react` and rendered in the main App component, which will track all page views and user interactions once deployed to Vercel.
